  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> is______."
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "27",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>We have,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo><mo>:</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Then,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></math></p><p>Solving both equations, we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>.</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0093_ba0f516026a3.png\" style=\"width: 405px; height: 265px;\" /></p><p>Required area</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>&#8202;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup><mo>&#8202;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8722;</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><mn>4</mn></msubsup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>12</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>16</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>27</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sq</mi><mo>.</mo><mi>units</mi></math></p>"
